* WQ MB-PC VRM: averaged AVP model, 30 -> 130 A load step (phase current = state node ni, A)
Bc 0 ni i=max(-4.56e+07,min(4.344e+08,502655*((1.25-v(vs))/0.0011-v(ni))))
Cni ni 0 1 ic=30
Bs 0 vs i=(v(out)-v(vs))/5e-07
Cvs vs 0 1 ic=1.217
Bph 0 out i=v(ni)
Cb out nb 0.00336 ic=1.217
Rb nb nb2 0.001
Lb nb2 0 2e-10
Cm out nm 0.0004 ic=1.217
Rm nm nm2 7.5e-05
Lm nm2 0 1e-11
Iload out 0 pwl(0 30 5e-05 30 5.1e-05 130 250u 130 0.000251 30 450u 30)
.options numdgt=7
.tran 10n 450u 0 20n uic
.meas tran vmin min v(out) from=50u to=230u
.meas tran v130 avg v(out) from=230u to=250u
.meas tran vmax max v(out) from=250u to=430u
.meas tran v30 avg v(out) from=430u to=450u
.end